  "steps": [
    "Cut chicken into strips; chop onion. Mix all sauce ingredients with 30g water until smooth.",
    "Bring pot of water to boil.",
    "Fry chicken in oil on medium-high 60 seconds; add onion; flip chicken; season with salt and pepper. Cook udon noodles 3 minutes in boiling water; drain.",
    "Add sauce to pan; stir on medium-low 2\u20133 minutes. Transfer noodles to pan; mix. Done!"
